<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 7.640 pct at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 7.640 pct at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday its offer of NZ$100 million of February 2001 bonds yielded an average 7.640 percent.</p>
<p>In a tender on January 30, $100 million of the same bonds yielded an average 7.185 percent.  </p>
<p>Bids totalled NZ$378 million in Thursday's tender and the successful bids ranged from 7.62 to 7.65 percent.</p>
<p>The bonds have an eight percent coupon, and the settlement date is March 4.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
